{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2022-05-10 01:00:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ EXPLORES THE KETCHUP BOTTLE OF TOMORROW', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEINZ, MAKER OF THE WORLD'S FAVORITE KETCHUP AND BELOVED CONDIMENTS, IS TEAMING UP WITH PULPEX TO DEVELOP A PAPER-BASED, RENEWABLE AND RECYCLABLE BOTTLE MADE FROM 100 PERCENT SUSTAINABLY SOURCED WOOD PULP. INNOVATING ITS ICONIC KETCHUP BOTTLE, HEINZ IS THE FIRST SAUCE BRAND TO TEST THE POTENTIAL OF PULPEX'S SUSTAINABLE PAPER BOTTLE PACKAGING FOR ITS RANGE OF WORLD-FAMOUS CONDIMENTS. FOR THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR THE “COMPANY”)"}